摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Android Mobile GUI Agent plugin for DeepSeek Harness with ADB control, iterative verification, approvals, and a Web mobile view","id":"gh:1333944343","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-mobile-gui-agent","slug":"kunjinkao-os/dsh-mobile-gui-agent","topics":["adb","android","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","gui-agent","mobile-automation","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Android Mobile GUI Agent plugin for DeepSeek Harness with ADB control, iterative verification, appro"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"vals, and a Web mobile view"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DeepSeek Harness Mobile GUI Agent"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文 | Changelog"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"`dsh-mobile-gui-agent` is an installable DeepSeek Harness plugin for controlling Android devices thr"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ough ADB. It adds a **mobile_gui_agent** entry to the Harness Web UI and drives every task through a"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"n observe → decide → act → verify loop."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"The repository is a single publishable npm package. The bundle patch inserts one Cordis plugin row; "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"that plugin composes the ADB Provider, the Phone Agent Consumer, the Phone tools, the Typert Remote "},{"id":"p5s3","text":"adapter, and the browser client under one lifecycle."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Connect and authorize an Android device, then install the pinned release into the Harness Web profil"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"nnect and authorize an Android device, then install the pinned release into the Harness Web profile:"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness: `^0.1.0-rc.5`\n- Verified against upstream commit `47f943859bef60e4160492346772de"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"d9b24f765a`\n- Also built and tested against the published `0.1.0-rc.6` Harness packages\n- Node.js: `"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0`\n- Android: a physical device or emulator visible to `adb devices`"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The package follows the upstream `dsh.bundle.patch` and `dsh.client` manifests. It does not patch th"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"e Harness Agent loop or require unpublished Phone packages."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## What it provides"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- ADB discovery, wireless connection, screenshots, UIAutomator hierarchy capture, tap, long press, s"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"wipe, verified text input/replacement, keys, back, home, and package launch\n- Screenshot and pruned "},{"id":"p14s3","text":"semantic UI observations with observation-local element IDs\n- Strict `phone_observe` and `phone_act`"},{"id":"p14s4","text":" Harness tools\n- One meaningful action per model turn followed by a fresh observation and determinis"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"tic verification\n- stale-element protection, adaptive screen stabilization, stuck detection, step an"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"d time limits, and recoverable ADB errors\n- Harness approval for semantic controls that can send, pu"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"blish, delete, purchase, pay, transfer, call, install, or change account security\n- A blank-session "},{"id":"p14s8","text":"**mobile_gui_agent** launcher and Web conversation tab with device selection, wireless connection, s"},{"id":"p14s9","text":"creenshot refresh, task controls, action overlays, and verified steps\n- A fake device and scripted s"},{"id":"p14s10","text":"tate transitions for keyless Agent-loop tests"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"This plugin does not install an Android accessibility service. It combines ADB screenshots with the "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"hierarchy produced by Android UIAutomator. Custom Canvas, WebView, game, and image-only controls may"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" be visible in the screenshot even when they are absent from the hierarchy; the Agent can use vision"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"-capable model input or an optional `PhoneVisionProvider` for those screens."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. Install Android Platform Tools and confirm `adb version` works.\n2. Enable Developer options and U"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"SB debugging on the Android device.\n3. Authorize the computer when Android shows the RSA debugging p"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"rompt.\n4. Confirm the device is usable:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The selected row must report `device`, not `offline` or `unauthorized`.\n5. Use a DeepSeek Harness We"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"b profile. The **mobile_gui_agent** entry is a browser client contribution and therefore is not show"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"n by a headless-only profile."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Root access and an APK installed on the phone are not required for observation, navigation, or print"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"able ASCII input. Unicode input uses the external ADB Keyboard helper (`com.android.adbkeyboard/.Adb"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"IME`). When that helper is installed, the plugin discovers it even if it is disabled, enables and se"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"lects it only for the Unicode operation, then restores the user's previous IME and enabled set. No m"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"odel setup action or user interaction is needed. If the helper is truly absent, configure an absolut"},{"id":"p20s6","text":"e host path to a reviewed APK with `adb.unicodeImeApkPath`; the plugin never downloads an APK, and i"},{"id":"p20s7","text":"nstallation still requires explicit Harness approval."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The existing Harness Agent owns planning and turn execution. Starting a Phone run installs only Agen"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"t-scoped Phone tools and the dedicated Phone system prompt. Each `phone_act` performs a fresh pre-ac"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"tion capture, validates the strict action, resolves semantic element bounds, requests approval if ne"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"eded, executes through `PhoneDevice`, waits for a stable screen, captures again, verifies the result"},{"id":"p23s5","text":", and returns the new observation to the same Agent loop."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The compact hierarchy removes invisible and meaningless containers, prioritizes text and interactive"},{"id":"p24s2","text":" nodes, assigns short IDs, and enforces element and serialized-byte limits. A `tap_element` action a"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"lso carries the observation ID. Before execution, the plugin revalidates the selected element's reso"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"urce ID, class, content description, and bounds; unrelated animation can continue, but a moved, miss"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"ing, changed, or ambiguous target is rejected as stale."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Security model"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- The model cannot issue arbitrary ADB shell text. Provider-owned diagnostic commands use a closed `"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"PhoneShellRequest` classification.\n- Consequential semantic controls require the existing Harness ap"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"proval service when `approvalEnabled` is true.\n- Unicode helper setup always requires the Harness ap"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"proval service, even when ordinary action approval is disabled.\n- Approval is one-shot. A denied, un"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"available, or cancelled approval becomes a structured action failure.\n- Raw coordinate actions canno"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"t always reveal their semantic effect. Review the visible target and use restrictive Harness permiss"},{"id":"p26s7","text":"ions when operating accounts, payment apps, or sensitive data.\n- Device actions are real. Use a test"},{"id":"p26s8","text":" device and a non-production account during evaluation."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Report security issues according to SECURITY.md."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- UIAutomator can omit Canvas, game, image-only, and some WebView controls.\n- Unicode text input req"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"uires a compatible external ADB Keyboard helper. Installed helpers are activated and restored transp"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"arently; installing a missing helper requires a reviewed APK at `adb.unicodeImeApkPath` and explicit"},{"id":"p29s4","text":" approval.\n- Wireless ADB latency and reliability depend on the network and the current Android debu"},{"id":"p29s5","text":"gging port.\n- Raw-coordinate actions cannot always be classified by semantic impact; use semantic el"},{"id":"p29s6","text":"ements and review approval prompts.\n- The MVP refreshes screenshots after observations and actions; "},{"id":"p29s7","text":"it does not stream scrcpy video."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
